---
import { SHOW_CLOX } from '../config';
---

<section class="h-sec" id="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container h-about">
    <img
      class="h-about-photo"
      src="/images/manny-headshot.webp"
      width="800"
      height="500"
      alt="Manny Pachano crouching on a lawn, holding out a hand to two Canada geese"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <div class="h-about-text">
      <h2 class="h-h2" id="about-title">About Manny</h2>
      <p class="h-p h-p-md">
        I started building WordPress sites for small businesses while I was in college. As the projects got bigger, I
        moved from WordPress themes to writing sites from scratch, and I taught myself JavaScript, PHP and design along
        the way.
      </p>
      <p class="h-p h-p-md">
        From 2023 to 2025 I worked at nuVector as a front-end developer on their B2B web apps, and I also worked on
        their SEO and marketing. Since 2024 I have run the TimeClick marketing website, including the design, the code, the CRM
        and checkout integrations, the SEO content and the email program.
      </p>
      <p class="h-p h-p-md">
        {SHOW_CLOX
          ? 'In 2026 I took on the website and SEO for Universal Environmental Services and started Clox, my own time-tracking app for crews in the trades.'
          : 'In 2026 I took on the website and SEO for Universal Environmental Services.'}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
